{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>Continual.</b> From day to day — with no intervening day breaking the sequence." "<b>Where I will meet with you.</b> When I fix an appointment to speak with you, there I will fix it to come. And there are among our Sages those who learn from here that from above the bronze altar the Holy One, blessed be He, would speak with Moses once the Tabernacle was erected, and there are those who say: from above the cover, as it says ״וְדִבַּרְתִּי אִתְּךָ מֵעַל הַכַּפֹּרֶת״ (Exodus 25), and ״אֲשֶׁר אִוָּעֵד לָכֶם״ stated here is not stated about the altar but about the Tent of Meeting mentioned in the verse."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:40.740757005Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}